# 3. Raw S3 layout

Use one directory per source table, followed by ingestion date and ingestion hour:

```text
s3://<raw-bucket>/
  oracle-cdc/
    dptf_source_system=oracle/
      dptf_source_database=trading/
        dptf_source_schema=TRADE/
          dptf_source_table=EXECUTIONS/
            dptf_ingest_date=2026-07-23/
              dptf_ingest_hour=10/
                *.parquet
```

Another table would have an independent path:

```text
s3://<raw-bucket>/
  oracle-cdc/
    dptf_source_system=oracle/
      dptf_source_database=trading/
        dptf_source_schema=TRADE/
          dptf_source_table=ORDERS/
            dptf_ingest_date=2026-07-23/
              dptf_ingest_hour=10/
                *.parquet
```

Oracle requires File Writer partitioning to be separated by table before additional partition levels are introduced. The resolved File Writer partition path is passed to the Parquet and S3 Event Handlers.

## Hourly partition configuration

GoldenGate partitioning is configured per fully qualified source table:

```properties
gg.eventhandler.s3.pathMappingTemplate=\
oracle-cdc/\
dptf_source_system=oracle/\
dptf_source_database=trading/\
dptf_source_schema=${schemaName}/\
dptf_source_table=${tableName}

gg.handler.s3.partitioner.TRADE.EXECUTIONS=\
dptf_ingest_date=${currentTimestamp[yyyy-MM-dd]}/\
dptf_ingest_hour=${currentTimestamp[HH]}

gg.handler.s3.partitioner.TRADE.ORDERS=\
dptf_ingest_date=${currentTimestamp[yyyy-MM-dd]}/\
dptf_ingest_hour=${currentTimestamp[HH]}
```

The same partition pattern should be generated for the remaining tables through configuration templating rather than manually maintained.

Oracle supports multiple independent table partition configurations inside one Replicat.

## Partition timestamp

`${currentTimestamp[...]}` is the time GoldenGate processes the operation.

Therefore:

```text
dptf_ingest_date
dptf_ingest_hour
```

represent **data-platform ingestion time**, not the source Oracle commit time.

Configure the GoldenGate deployment/JVM timezone as UTC so partition boundaries are consistent.

Preserve the source transaction time separately as:

```text
dptf_source_operation_ts
```

