## Final decisions

```text
Raw storage:
    Parquet only

Avro:
    temporary internal GoldenGate conversion format

Replicats:
    start with one Classic Replicat for all 50 tables

Partitioning:
    source table + ingestion date + ingestion hour

File rolling:
    10 minutes or 256 MB, whichever occurs first

Watermark:
    one row per processed table/hour

File manifest:
    none

Late data:
    two-hour overlap plus daily 24–48-hour reconciliation

Deduplication:
    dptf_event_id in Bronze Iceberg

Schema evolution:
    GoldenGate writes new Parquet files with the new schema;
    Spark normalizes compatible changes into Bronze
```
